{"id":51325,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-gloria-do-ribatejo-2\/"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:38:58","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:38:58","slug":"trail-gloria-do-ribatejo","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-gloria-do-ribatejo\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>XII Trail Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo \u2013 Desafia o Trilho 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), na t\u00edpica vila de <strong>Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Salvaterra de Magos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Organizada pela dedicada <strong>Sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail do SCD Gl\u00f3ria do Ribatejo<\/strong> com o apoio do Munic\u00edpio e da Junta de Freguesia local, a prova pontua para o Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo (CTR) e para os Campeonatos da ATRP.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal a partir das <strong>08:30<\/strong>, o percurso leva os participantes a desfrutarem da beleza \u00edmpar da charneca ribatejana, dos seus trilhos arenosos e das tradi\u00e7\u00f5es locais em quatro op\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 <strong>30 km<\/strong>, <strong>18 km<\/strong>, <strong>10 km<\/strong> e caminhada \u2014, culminando no concorrido almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio tradicional.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">1 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-bo